{"id":286458557,"title":"1.day1","summary":"第一章.协程第二章.协程的使用","content":"<h1>第一章.协程</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790415560254-3cc71289-44db-403e-a142-6ed5811bb056.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第二章.协程的使用</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790415609696-151f71dc-3178-4a34-bca8-f4703fde0975.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790415711601-9b39a037-0fbe-4440-bbde-34a54896b33a.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790415717865-6ae3f3ff-6d19-4d5c-9302-3df717679cc4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第三章.WSGI和ASGI</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790415729158-edd47091-8a39-42ab-8909-0c71d1ebaaef.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790416168504-ebae5eb4-d685-4014-9a8d-bb2790755e6a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第四章.FastAPI框架</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790416194678-51808df3-162a-4cfc-9e85-91c35ce3bef4.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790416199990-daf7b75a-2056-471c-86c6-8c684290c0d5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790416219117-82cb42eb-1a63-4ce5-bacc-3755cfc75056.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790428485167-c4b4ece8-ccac-44e2-930e-5834302a90dd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个是我们的本机地址<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1790428510624-15120758-36f6-49fd-bbd9-4cdaa9c5583d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer